flowchart TB
  REAL[Real hardware backends] --> SVC[Versioned service APIs]
  SIM[Desktop simulator backends] --> SVC
  REPLAY[Replay / fault injection] --> SVC
  SVC --> CORE[Video-priority application core]
  CORE --> APPS[FPV · Balance · Media · Flights · Batteries · Aircraft · Diagnostics · Settings]
  APPS --> UI[Qt 6 / QML shell + RGB overlays]
  SVC --> DB[(SQLite)]
